    "note": "A mitred pipe has exactly area x path length: pi x 70. Inside the block: a quarter of each leg, the mitre (the cut on the corner's bisecting plane) takes a wedge off each leg's quarter: the integral of the distance across the leg over the quarter section, (r_out^3 - r_in^3) / 3, twice (r 1: 2/3). Join adds the rest: V = 12000 + 70 pi - (17.5 pi - 2/3). FreeCAD's default corner failed here.",
